# Never bake a local configuration file into the image. tld18Server/appsettings.json holds the
# pepper and the database address. The deployment binds the file onto /app/appsettings.json at run
# time, so the image needs no copy. The development file holds a placeholder pepper and a local
# database address, and a container never reads it.
**/appsettings.json
**/appsettings.Development.json

# The image builds the server only. These paths keep the build context small.
